window.products.push({"id":584007,"name":"Portable Blender, Personal Blender for Shakes and Smoothies 300W Super Motor 20Oz Smoothie Blender USB Rechargeable Small Fresh Juice Blender 6000mAh ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Z1Z5ObFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍨【Compact Portable Design】:Compact design Mini blender has a super \"heart\" 300W but weighs only 2 lb. You can take it wherever you go such as beach party,camping,world travel,and other outdoor sports. You can use it for DIY delicious frozen cocktails, smoothies, milkshakes for you or friends. You can not only enjoy the joy of homemade smoothies, but you can also enjoy healthier drinks, and it can even save you a lot of money and time. (mechine base,20Oz bottle,normal lid) 🍓【300W Superior Portable Power】-(1)As powerful as most countertop blender which can easily crush ice cube,frozen fruit for cold drink and smoothies and blend fruits like a breeze.(2) 3X powerful than other usb rechargeable small blender and it is faster and stronger than the original, but just as simple to use (3)With 20000RMP super speed, you can get delicious juice in 20s/30s. No waiting which means you can make a delicious juice quickly on a busy morning or before doing sports within 20S. 🍊【6000mAh Super long battery life】:The built-in 6000mAh USB rechargeable battery can be charged in a variety of adapters such as computer,mobile power,power bank etc. 3-4 hours charged can support 30+ cups of juice. The battery capacity is 3x that of 2000 mAh other blender. Extra large capacity battery allows personal blender to be used twice as long as other juicers. Longer lasting single charge battery life and no plugs required that means it's more convient and perfect for travel. 🍉【Upgrade Pulse Technology】-300W Super Mini Juicer with PULSE TECHNOLOGY. The only personal size blender with pulse technology. Pulse technology allows the small personal blender to have 2 working modes. General mode, 20S of continuous high speed blending for softer foods. Pulse mode, 30S of high and low speed intelligent switching for more delicate blending for harder foods. More professional portable smoothie blender makes blending become quick and simple. 💝【Safe and Simple Operation】:Smoothie maker uses high quality food-grade Tritan material. It also has intelligent safety protection system: overheating protection, overload protection, card machine protection. Juice blender only be turned on when bottle install in right position. Press the button to work immediately. And you can get a delicious smoothie in 20S/30S . After daily use, just add some water in and press the button to enter “self-clean” mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Z1Z5ObFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eenten","source_asin":"B09QCTVH96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QCTVH96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QCTVH96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
