window.products.push({"id":584296,"name":"Refrigerator Organizer Bins, Clear Pantry Organization and Storage with Cutout Handles, Set Of 6 Stackable Plastic Freezer Organizer Bins for Fridge, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PQB0QdrHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY AND FOOD SAFE: Made of durable high quality shatter proof BPA free chlorine free PET plastic. Easy to clean! Wash with mild soapy water or water. Do not place in dishwasher!The small organizing bins measures 10\" x 4\" x 3\", the medium organizing bins measures 10\" x 6\" x 3\", the large organizing bins measures 11.2\" x 7.8\" x 6\". UPGRADE YOUR FRIDGE ORGANIZER SPACE: Messy display will waste too much space. Use the refrigerator storage bins to reasonably classify your food, save refrigerator space and organize more food. The clear plastic makes it easy to see where the food is placed and saving you the time to find food. IDEAL SIZED - storage bins fit pouches, food packets, juice boxes, jars, baby food, bottles, canned goods, fruits, yogurts, cheese, and more. Also good for storing dry goods in the pantry. Ideal for kitchens, countertops, pantry shelves, refrigerators, freezers, cabinets, or as drawer organizers. FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE – Easily stack these organizing bins on top of one another or put them side by side. The base feet allow more than one bin to be neatly stacked without shifting. These versatile storage bins can be used in any room of the home - use them in craft rooms, laundry/utility rooms, bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchens, toy room and more. MONEY BACK GUARANTEE – If you are not satisfied with your storage bins for any reason, please contact us directly for a refund or replacement, or if you have any suggestions for better improvement, please contact us. We are always committed to building a better life.So click the Add to Cart button now, knowing your purchase is protected by our Money Back Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PQB0QdrHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Xianchow","source_asin":"B096MPMCWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096MPMCWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096MPMCWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":584297,"name":"Ritzy 100% Merino Wool Lap Throw Blanket, Warm Grey - 53x43 Inches, 1.5 Lb, 350 GSM - Lightweight, Breathable, Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v3Vi+HxES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHTWEIGHT 350 GSM MERINO WOOL - Ritzy Merino Wool Throws contain only 100% pure wool fibres of superior 26-28 microns fineness. Ritzy Merino Wool Throws are suitable for light insulation indoors, and warmer evening temperatures at the cottage, cabin, camping, around the fire pit, or while enjoying outdoor events. NON-SHEDDING - During our unique milling and finishing process, moisture, heat, and friction are carefully applied to tighten the weave and improve the feel and texture of our blankets, ensuring that your Ritzy blanket will be shedding resistant, and easily machine washable by following simple care instructions. 100% PURE WOOL - Ritzy wool blankets do not contain any cheap, synthetic fillers like acrylic, nylon, or polyester! In our experience, synthetic fibres are not breathable or moisture absorbent, they stain easily and tend to retain odours. They are prone to static electricity, which results in more shedding, as fibres cling and transfer onto other surfaces. MACHINE WASHABLE - Ritzy wool blankets are easy to care for and you don’t need to wash them often, in fact, it’s best to wash them sparingly. When selecting a wash cycle, look for your washing machine's wool-specific cycle. If your machine does not have a wool-specific cycle, make sure to select a gentle, cold water cycle, that does not agitate the blanket harshly. SLEEP BETTER & LONGER - Wool blankets, throws, and bedding are known to reduce irritation for allergy sufferers while offering superior temperature regulation to help you sleep better and longer. Wool easily absorbs up to 30% of its weight in moisture in the form of humidity and perspiration without feeling damp, promptly releasing it to drier environments, while keeping a layer of dry air next to the skin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v3Vi+HxES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritzy","source_asin":"B096N6S92L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096N6S92L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096N6S92L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
