window.products.push({"id":584315,"name":"Temp-tations Set-of-4 10oz Squoval Ramekins w/Lid-Its (Tray), Mini Bakers Single Serving (Floral Lace Red) 107","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCDjDpzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great size for dessert cups, single serving or individual side dishes. Squoval is a rectangle - or square - with rounded corners. 10 oz design. So 4 ramekins will hold one regular boxed cake mix (fill each 2/3 full). Use the lid-it (tray) as a trivet under the dish OR on top of the dish as a cover. You can put ice in the ramekin and cold hors d'oeuvres in the lid-it over top of the ice. Includes FOUR mini bakers (ramekins) AND 4 matching lid-its. Dishwasher-, freezer-, and microwave-safe; oven-safe to 500F. No plastic covers with these but plastic wrap works great and is air tight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCDjDpzgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Temp-tations Ovenware","source_asin":"B084HMLNMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084HMLNMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084HMLNMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":584316,"name":"Yamco Retirement Gifts for Women Blanket - Retirement Gifts 60\"x 50\" Blankets - Retirement Gifts for Men - Farewell Gifts for Coworkers Boss - Funny R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HWqb0NSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design Description:Full-Width Printing, Single-Sided Printing, Clear Printing. It'S Wrinkle And Fade Resistant, Doesn'T Shed, And Is Suitable For All Seasons. Size Description:There Are Three Sizes To Choose From, 50 X 40 Inches Suitable For Children,60 X 50 For Teens, 80 X 60 For Adults. Product Performance:The Blanket Is Constructed Of High-Quality Flannel That Is Soft To Touch, Supple, Easy To Care For, And Lightweight, More Comfortable And Warm. Does Not Absorb Any Moisture. Lightweight, Durable, And Can Be Folded Compactly. Super Soft And Feels Great, Anti-Wrinkle, Anti-Allergic, Non-Replaceable Feature, Very Suitable For Those Who Are Prone To Allergies And Discomfort! Applicable Scene:Bed Sofa, Couch, Bedroom, Living Room, Guest Room, Kids Room, Rv, Vacation House. It Is Also Perfect Use For Family Outdoors Activity, Camping, Cinema, Traveling, Sports And Beach. Multi-Function Use:Be Used As Wearable Blanket, Sofa Blanket, Bed Blanket, Travel Blanket, Picnic Mat, Etc. The Outside Has Super Soft High-Quality Fabrics, And The Inside Is White. It Will Be A Special Gift At Birthday, Christmas, New Year'S Day, Thanksgiving, And Bring Fun To Your Family, Friends, Classmates. Easy To Care:It Is Machine Washable, Hand Washing And Dryable For Easy Care. No Shrinkage, No Colour Fading, Durable，And No Unravelling After Washing. But Do Not Use Bleach. Romantic Gift：Give The Blanket To Your Family Or Friends As A Gift. They Will Be Happy! It Will Be A Great Gift For Birthdays, Anniversary, Graduation, Christmas, New Year's Day, Thanksgiving, And Other Festivals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HWqb0NSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yamco","source_asin":"B09X1MGZ3X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X1MGZ3X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X1MGZ3X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":584317,"name":"FOOTBALL LOLLY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSEc+RiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KSEc+RiWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJPLKG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJPLKG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJPLKG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
