window.products.push({"id":584363,"name":"Coaster Home Furnishings 704028 Coffee Table, Antique Nutmeg/Gunmetal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zz2cgFlNL._AC_.jpg","description":"Casual spaces come to life with the rustic appeal of this coffee table. Angular and linear design elements offer an eye-catching look and a crisp silhouette. With a lovely warm antique nutmeg finish table top, it creates a versatile embellishment to surrounding pieces. Open squared side units are made from metal and given a cool gunmetal finish. Bring an industrial-inspired look with modern flavor to any casual living area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zz2cgFlNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coaster Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B018FND7DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018FND7DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018FND7DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":584364,"name":"Deluxe Round Natural African Basket - Medium 14\" Round - by market women in Bolgatanga, Ghana with Africa Heartwood Project - GBMRN (Flat-packed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-4hhxxGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Deluxe Medium Round Natural African Basket from Africa Heartwood Project is simple and elegant, and contains no dyes or patterns - just the light brown color of the dried grass itself. This is the medium size, measuring about 14-15\" round and 8\" tall, plus the 4\" handle for 12\" approximate total height. They're each equipped with durable, soft leather handles and the medium 14\" size is suitable for use in light shopping, collecting vegetables, holding hand towels or small books, for medium pot of flowers, or as a stunning home decor accent. --- Each deluxe basket in our collection is made from the elephant grass which grows in the rich flood plains of the White Volta near the village of Bolgatanga, Northern Ghana. We love that women artisans, working in family & village co-operatives, hand-weave each basket using traditional techniques handed down from generation to generation. Non-profit Africa Heartwood Project supports the sustainable livelihoods of cultural artisans in developing countries by providing training, investment, and access to global markets. Your purchase helps preserve traditional crafts & culture, increases income for many working families, and supports charitable projects among the poor in West Africa. -------- Your new basket will come either flat-packed or fully-shaped - you choose which! To save money select flat-packed, reducing storage and shipping costs. Easily reshape by simply spraying or immersing in water, shaking of excess water, hand shaping while wet, then allowing to air dry. 5 minutes of basket love and your done! Or, select fully-shaped and you'll get a basket we have already soaked, shaped, and dried, so it comes delivered to you ready to use or display. Either way, we include a care and shaping guide to help you keep your basket looking its best. --------- Pictures and specifications are provided for reference only. Every basket is hand made and unique, but have confidence that your new basket will very closely match","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-4hhxxGTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Africa Heartwood Project","source_asin":"B0B2871X64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2871X64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2871X64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
