window.products.push({"id":584369,"name":"KeeKit Refrigerator Thermometer, 4 Pack Digital Freezer Thermometer, Upgraded Fridge Thermometer with Large LCD Display, Max/Min Record Function for K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QS6RRDf7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large LCD Display】This refrigerator thermometer has an easy to read electronic LCD display, you can monitor the accurate temperature (included max/min/immediate temperature) info of your refrigerator / freezer room all the time. 【Easy to Operate】It is easy to operate this freezer thermometer with 3 buttons, just press the “ON /OFF” button to switch the digital thermometer on/off. Press “℃/℉” button to select centigrade or Fahrenheit. Press “CLEAR” button to reset the Max/Min Temperature. 【Accurate & Wide Measuring Range】Temperature range: -50℃ to 70℃ (-58℉ to 158℉), accuracy: ±1℃/(±1.8℉). Allowing you to use this in the fridge and freezer. It can act the role of general indoor thermometer. 【Battery Powered】Comes with CR2032 battery which can be replaced when it is exhausted. It is convenient for you to replace with a new CR2032 battery by opening the ABS shell and pulling it out directly. 【3 Support Methods】This fridge thermometer has 3 different place methods. Either use the stand to place it on the table, flip the stand over and use the hook to hang it on, or adsorb to the refrigerator. Mini design makes it small and portable, and won't take too much places of your fridge. All KeeKit products are protected by our 60 Day Money Back Guarantee & 12 Month Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QS6RRDf7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeeKit","source_asin":"B09JZGYZXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZGYZXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZGYZXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
