window.products.push({"id":584588,"name":"Ah-So Wine Opener Old Fashion Two-Prong Cork Puller Corkscrew Luxury Stainless Steel Wine Bottle Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sU-fkxW3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bigger And Stronger--Compared with most similar Ah So wine opener, it is bigger and stronger.The head is a large semicircle shape, large size, convenient to hold, more comfortable. Easy Use - The simple design of our two-prong cork remover provides a smooth experience when you open your favorite bottle of wine. To open a bottle of wine, insert the two prongs into the bottle on the outside of the cork and push them down as far as they go. Twist the cork puller back and forth until the cork pops! Pure Stainless Steel - Our ‘AH-SO’ wine opener is made with stainless steel for high-end durability while maintaining a sleek look,Includes sheath to protect prongs which the surface is sprayed with rubber paint, comfortable to handle. KEEP YOUR CORK INTACT - Your vintage corks are safe when you use the Two-Prong Cork Puller. Unlike standard rabbit corkscrews, our wine cork extractor keeps the cork intact. The two prongs carefully “hug” the cork and pull it out, keeping the cork intact. This allows you to save the cork for your collection and protect your expensive wine. DELUXE GIFT CASE - The Ah So wine bottle opener is pack with sleek metal case. Our cork puller is a fantastic gifting choice for any wine enthusiast! It is a gift that will be appreciated thoroughly for Birthdays, Anniversaries, or any special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sU-fkxW3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Drincarier","source_asin":"B0BLK2GTN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-584588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLK2GTN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLK2GTN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
